            ]
          },
          "731900104": {
            "id": "731900104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This means they probably do have a secret hideout around here — and that means treasure!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731900105"
            ]
          },
          "731900105": {
            "id": "731900105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm. Soheil's notes did mention that the Eremites here would appear and disappear out of the blue. They sure sound like a dangerous bunch.",
